  "id": "effects",
  "name": "Effects",
  "section": "video",
  "pack": "video-wan-effects",
  "status": "ready",
  "higgsfield_feature": "Effects",
  "summary": "Turns a photo into a 5-second effect clip: 30 open effect LoRAs, from Cakeify and a robot face reveal to money rain and a 360° orbit (Wan 2.1 image-to-video).",
  "workflow": "workflow.api.json",
  "source": {
    "template": "image_to_video_wan.json",
    "comfyui": "0.42.0",
    "notes": "fp8 weights instead of fp16. Each effect option swaps the effect LoRA that sits after the model loader (Remade-AI's for 30 effects; joyfox's, ostris's and lvfengchun's for the other 5) and writes a prompt modeled on the example in that LoRA's model card (trigger words included), with your subject in it. lightx2v's step-distill LoRA is added at strength 0 (a no-op) for the fast preset. Flow shift 5, as Remade-AI's cards recommend."
  },
